<title>USA: Cherry Corp opens Hong Kong purchasing office.</title>
<headline>Cherry Corp opens Hong Kong purchasing office.</headline>
<dateline>WAUKEGAN, Ill. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cherry Corp said Thursday it has established an international purchasing office at its current operation in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Cherry said the office will further its efforts to develop suppliers within the Pacific Rim region.</p>
<p>Cherry provides electrical products and semiconductors.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
